"use strict";(self.webpackChunksketch_blog=self.webpackChunksketch_blog||[]).push([[1279],{481(s,n,a){a.r(n),a.d(n,{_pageData:()=>t,default:()=>o});var e=a(641);const t=JSON.parse('{"path":"/blog/2026-06-vuepress-sketch-setup.html","title":"VuePress 2 手绘风搭建笔记","lang":"zh-CN","frontmatter":{"title":"VuePress 2 手绘风搭建笔记","date":"2026-06-17T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["VuePress","工程"]},"git":{"updatedTime":1781750887000,"contributors":[{"name":"Hermes Agent","username":"","email":"hermes@nas.local","commits":1}],"changelog":[{"hash":"b06c2119657ed159d9af228d79c473d4dc6b896f","time":1781750887000,"email":"hermes@nas.local","author":"Hermes Agent","message":"feat: 手绘风主题 + 内容页面"}]},"filePathRelative":"blog/2026-06-vuepress-sketch-setup.md"}'),p={name:"2026-06-vuepress-sketch-setup.md"},o=(0,a(6262).A)(p,[["render",function(s,n,a,t,p,o){return(0,e.uX)(),(0,e.CE)("div",null,[...n[0]||(n[0]=[(0,e.Fv)('<h1 id="vuepress-2-手绘风搭建笔记" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vuepress-2-手绘风搭建笔记"><span>VuePress 2 手绘风搭建笔记</span></a></h1><blockquote><p>折腾了两天，总算把这个博客跑起来了。记一笔。</p></blockquote><h2 id="缘起" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#缘起"><span>缘起</span></a></h2><p>一直想开个博客，但 Jekyll/Hugo 的默认主题都太&quot;程序员审美&quot;了。 某天看到一位画师用 Excalidraw 画的博客设计稿，突然就上头了—— &quot;我也要这种，像翻笔记本一样的感觉。&quot;</p><h2 id="技术选型" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#技术选型"><span>技术选型</span></a></h2><table><thead><tr><th>方案</th><th>优点</th><th>缺点</th><th>选不选</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hexo</td><td>生态成熟</td><td>主题丑</td><td>❌</td></tr><tr><td>Hugo</td><td>构建飞快</td><td>Go 模板恶心</td><td>❌</td></tr><tr><td>Astro</td><td>现代</td><td>主题少</td><td>❌</td></tr><tr><td><strong>VuePress 2</strong></td><td>主题漂亮，可深度定制</td><td>配置复杂</td><td>✅</td></tr></tbody></table><p>最后选了 VuePress 2。理由很简单：defaultTheme 底子够干净，CSS 变量全开放，方便我往手绘风硬掰。</p><h2 id="关键踩坑" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#关键踩坑"><span>关键踩坑</span></a></h2><h3 id="_1-esbuild-不会解析-vue-文件" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-esbuild-不会解析-vue-文件"><span>1. ESBuild 不会解析 <code>.vue</code> 文件</span></a></h3><p>VuePress 2 RC 用 esbuild 预编译 theme entry，所以<strong>自定义 <code>Layout.vue</code> 不会被 esbuild 处理</strong>。</p><p>试过的弯路：</p><ol><li>加 <code>@vuepress/bundler-vite</code> → 没用，webpack 路径下 esbuild 还是先跑</li><li>改 <code>viteBundler()</code> → 项目还在跑 webpack bundler</li><li>用 <code>await import(&#39;./theme/index.js&#39;)</code> → esbuild 还是能静态分析</li></ol><p>最终方案：<strong>只继承 defaultTheme，扩展用 defaultTheme 提供的插槽 API</strong>（<code>navbar</code>、<code>sidebar</code>、<code>page</code>）， 不写自定义 <code>Layout.vue</code>。反正手绘风主要靠 CSS，不需要重写 layout 结构。</p><h3 id="_2-scss-变量不生效" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-scss-变量不生效"><span>2. SCSS 变量不生效</span></a></h3><p>第一次写 <code>styles/config.scss</code> 时，<strong>把变量名写错了</strong>——VuePress 2 的变量前缀是 <code>$</code> 不是 <code>$vp-</code>。 后来查文档发现，defaultTheme 的可覆盖变量在 <a href="https://github.com/vuepress/theme-default/blob/main/src/client/styles/variables.scss" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">这里</a>。</p><h3 id="_3-中文字体本地化" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-中文字体本地化"><span>3. 中文字体本地化</span></a></h3><p>Google Fonts 在国内访问不稳，所以所有字体都下到 <code>docs/public/fonts/</code> 本地化：</p><div class="language-scss line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="scss"><pre><code class="language-scss"><span class="line"><span class="token atrule"><span class="token rule">@font-face</span></span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">font-family</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token string">&#39;Ma Shan Zheng&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">src</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token url">url</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">&#39;/fonts/MaShanZheng-Regular.ttf&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token function">format</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">&#39;truetype&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">font-display</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> swap<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>字体文件随仓库 commit 进去，构建出来直接走 <code>/fonts/xxx.ttf</code>。</p><h2 id="手绘风怎么做" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#手绘风怎么做"><span>手绘风怎么做</span></a></h2><p>核心就三招：</p><ol><li><strong>抖动边框</strong>：给卡片加 <code>transform: rotate(-0.5deg)</code>，肉眼几乎察觉不到，但叠加起来就有&quot;手摆&quot;的感觉</li><li><strong>纸张背景</strong>：body 上叠两层 linear-gradient——左边 48px 处一条 1px 红色竖线（模仿笔记本的边距线），加上横向 32px 重复的浅灰细线</li><li><strong>手写体标题</strong>：<code>font-family: &#39;Ma Shan Zheng&#39;</code> 一上，整个气质就变了</li></ol><div class="language-scss line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="scss"><pre><code class="language-scss"><span class="line"><span class="token selector">body </span><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">background-image</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span></span>\n<span class="line">    <span class="token function">linear-gradient</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>to right<span class="token punctuation">,</span> transparent 0<span class="token punctuation">,</span> transparent 48px<span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">      <span class="token function">rgba</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>193<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 74<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 58<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 0.18<span class="token punctuation">)</span> 48px<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token function">rgba</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>193<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 74<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 58<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 0.18<span class="token punctuation">)</span> 49px<span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">      transparent 49px<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">    <span class="token function">repeating-linear-gradient</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>to bottom<span class="token punctuation">,</span> transparent 0<span class="token punctuation">,</span> transparent 31px<span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">      <span class="token function">rgba</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>30<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 30<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 30<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 0.05<span class="token punctuation">)</span> 31px<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token function">rgba</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>30<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 30<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 30<span class="token punctuation">,</span> 0.05<span class="token punctuation">)</span> 32px<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="还差什么" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#还差什么"><span>还差什么</span></a></h2><ul><li>[ ] RSS 订阅（<code>@vuepress/plugin-feed</code>）</li><li>[ ] 评论系统（暂时不打算加）</li><li>[ ] 深色模式的手绘感调优</li><li>[ ] 移动端菜单折叠</li></ul><p>慢慢来。</p><hr><p><em>写于一个失眠的周二夜里。</em></p>',28)])])}]])}}]);